| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npx vitest run` | Run all unit tests |
| `npx vitest run tests/integration` | Run integration tests |
| `npx vitest --coverage` | Generate coverage report |
| `npx playwright test` | Run E2E collaboration tests |

